    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339270/extras/93eed0b12149fd752ba6750ecc0e824c.avif?t=1743787320\" data-has-big width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game that utilizes real physics simulation, where the protagonist interacts with props in the scene through a physics simulation engine. Therefore, every time you play, it offers you a different experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339270/extras/0dc4bba6ddc7ab70b87bfd34630eaed4.avif?t=1743787320\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: INTERACTIVE PHYSICS SIMULATION, the ladies will react automatically with true physics engine simulation.\u00a0 Controlling equipment to create your own poses.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339270/extras/9a25b89151dd00cbbaee9d48ff0e662c.poster.avif?t=1743787320\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339270/extras/9a25b89151dd00cbbaee9d48ff0e662c.webm?t=1743787320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339270/extras/9a25b89151dd00cbbaee9d48ff0e662c.mp4?t=1743787320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So many ladies are waiting for you, enjoy!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339270/extras/e6da091ed900a39f1d97fdd2aa01d81b.poster.avif?t